# │    Clinician  →  Username: clinician@H001.hosp     Password: clinician123 │
# │    Reception  →  Username: receptionist@H001.hosp  Password: reception123 │
# │                                                                           │
# │  Hospital B (H002):                                                       │
# │    Clinician  →  Username: clinician@H002.hosp     Password: clinician123 │
# │    Reception  →  Username: receptionist@H002.hosp  Password: reception123 │
# ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
